[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7981.43, "timestamp": "02:13:01", "text": "彼此。唯一的区别在于……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7983.229, "timestamp": "02:13:03", "text": "是位于之间的地质塔"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7986.87, "timestamp": "02:13:06", "text": "我们。所以我才问这个问题。如果我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7989.709, "timestamp": "02:13:09", "text": "网络速度很快，而且他的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7993.43, "timestamp": "02:13:13", "text": "速度慢，唯一的原因是塔楼……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7997.91, "timestamp": "02:13:17", "text": "身体更向我倾斜。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8000.87, "timestamp": "02:13:20", "text": "那么，你能让塔向哪边倾斜呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8003.03, "timestamp": "02:13:23", "text": "因为他家，我不需要快速"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8010.47, "timestamp": "02:13:30", "text": "他当时说：“先生，如果我们那样做，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8012.669, "timestamp": "02:13:32", "text": "然后是坐在你旁边的那个人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8015.75, "timestamp": "02:13:35", "text": "他家网速会很慢。” 我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8017.75, "timestamp": "02:13:37", "text": "比如，“是的，你说的有道理。”"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8019.75, "timestamp": "02:13:39", "text": "那我们该怎么办？”他回答说：“你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8022.87, "timestamp": "02:13:42", "text": "知道什么？每当苏西需要快速"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8026.069, "timestamp": "02:13:46", "text": "通过互联网，他可以随时来看你，而你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8027.91, "timestamp": "02:13:47", "text": "两者都能享受高速网络。我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8032.069, "timestamp": "02:13:52", "text": "先生，这是一个很好的答案。经过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8034.47, "timestamp": "02:13:54", "text": "对了，你晚饭吃了什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8036.229, "timestamp": "02:13:56", "text": "感觉就像我吃了羊肉。我当时就想，啊，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8037.47, "timestamp": "02:13:57", "text": "那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8039.91, "timestamp": "02:13:59", "text": "因为他们也很幽默，所以挺好的。"}]